OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally cloudy to start
OL,6,FSunday with outbreaks of light and
OL,7,Fpatchy rain possible. Drier through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with some bright spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,10,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud increasing overnight,
OL,13,Fwith showery rain arriving from the
OL,14,Fwest, this potentially heavy at times.
OL,15,FA rather mild night under the blanket
OL,16,Fof cloud with light westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
