OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA cloudy Monday with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof light patchy rain. Drier through
OL,7,Fthe evening before being replaced by
OL,8,Fheavy and persistent rain pushing
OL,9,Fsouth overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,12,Frain, perhaps heavy, clearing later
OL,13,FTuesday. A mix of bright spells and
OL,14,Fshowers is expected to persist through
OL,15,FWednesday and Thursday. Temperatures
OL,16,Fcloser to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
